        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=16,\\ y=-7$",
          "worked": "Multiply (1) by 4 and (2) by 3.\n$$\\begin{align*}8x+12y&=44\\quad(3)\\\\9x+12y&=60\\quad(4)\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract (3) from (4).\n$$\\begin{align*}(9x+12y)-(8x+12y)&=60-44\\\\x&=16\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into (1).\n$$\\begin{align*}2(16)+3y&=11\\\\32+3y&=11\\\\3y&=-21\\\\y&=-7\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
