        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1,\\ y=3$",
          "worked": "Multiply (1) by 4 and (2) by 3.\n$$\\begin{align*}12x+32y&=108\\quad(3)\\\\12x+9y&=39\\quad(4)\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract (4) from (3).\n$$\\begin{align*}(12x+32y)-(12x+9y)&=108-39\\\\23y&=69\\\\y&=3\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into (2).\n$$\\begin{align*}4x+3(3)&=13\\\\4x+9&=13\\\\4x&=4\\\\x&=1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0,
