        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-2,\\ y=\\dfrac{1}{2}$",
          "worked": "Multiply (1) by 3 and (2) by 2.\n$$\\begin{align*}27x-12y&=-60\\quad(3)\\\\10x-12y&=-26\\quad(4)\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract (4) from (3).\n$$\\begin{align*}(27x-12y)-(10x-12y)&=-60-(-26)\\\\17x&=-34\\\\x&=-2\\end{align*}$$\nSubstitute into (1).\n$$\\begin{align*}9(-2)-4y&=-20\\\\-18-4y&=-20\\\\-4y&=-2\\\\y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
